window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"drmundo","b":"masteryi","win":["Dr. Mundo","Dr. Mundo","Dr. Mundo","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2","text":"Your slow and bulk make every trade unprofitable — and Alpha Strike is 20s at rank 1."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows — Infected Bonesaw stops kiting him while it runs."},{"when":"1st item","text":"The flip: Wuju Style's true damage ignores every point of HP and armour you stack. Stop soloing him; ping the jungler."},{"when":"Late","text":"Two items of true DPS kill even a full-stack Mundo. Buy Grievous Wounds for Meditate — you own no CC to interrupt it."}],"wants":{"you":["Early cleaver bullying","Jungle help at his spikes","Frontline with team peel"],"foe":["Survive to first item","Wuju Style true damage","Clean 1v1s late"]},"early":"Bully the weakling phase. Cleaver poke plus your regen beats his feeble early autos, and at 3 the cleaver still out-values his pre-item damage. Alpha Strike costs 50 mana on a 20s cooldown and turns him untargetable, so don't spend into the dash. Chip him off CS relentlessly — this gold is your whole insurance policy.","mid":"At 4-5 Wuju Style's true damage bites through the health stacking, and by 6 Highlander (85s) makes him immune to slows, so Infected Bonesaw stops kiting him while it runs. Meditate is a 10s channel you own no CC to break — bring Grievous Wounds instead, and ping your jungler, because his first item is the flip.","late":"Respect what he becomes: two items of true damage kill even a full-stack Mundo, so the solo sidelane duel is no longer yours. Play frontline with your team, body-block for carries, cleave-slow him whenever Highlander is down, and make him burn his whole kit on a health bar your team punishes him for chasing.","whys":["Dr. Mundo owns level 1 — cleaver poke and regen flatly beat his weak early autos. Chip him for free.","Level 2 stays yours: your slow and raw tankiness mean no trade he takes turns a profit.","Level 3 is yours — the cleaver still out-values everything his pre-item kit produces.","Levels 4-5 go even as Wuju Style's true damage bites through health stacking. Armour won't help; the free lane ends.","Level 6 stays even — Highlander (85s) makes him slow-immune, so your Q stops kiting him for its whole duration.","First item is Master Yi's: true-damage DPS outpaces your regen and ignores every point of HP you stack. Stop soloing him.","Two-plus items stay his — true damage kills even a full Mundo because it bypasses everything you build. Fight him with teammates or not at all."]});
